Package: krubus-kernel-hook
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: KRubus Project <https://github.com/GamingTux/KRubus>
Depends: dpkg
Description: Ensure /boot/firmware always boots the active KRubus +pi5 kernel
 Installs a lightweight post-install kernel and initramfs hook (zz-krubus-kernel)
 that syncs /boot/firmware/kernel_2712.img and kernel8.img to the exact ABI
 version targeted by linux-image-rpi-2712 and linux-image-rpi-v8, bypassing
 GNU sort -V ordering quirks between '+rpt-' and '+rpt+1-'.
